WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:07.498
GCA, Go China Access, is a fixed-supply Web3 community and member ecosystem deployed on Base Mainnet.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:17.925
GCA has a fixed supply of one billion tokens, with no subsequent mint function and a publicly verifiable on-chain identity.

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:27.118
We connect global users with Chinese innovation through bilingual content, public research, and community collaboration.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:37.954
Membership uses verifiable on-chain holdings to provide research tools, risk analysis, learning content, and product access.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:48.625
GCA follows a non-custodial direction. Users control their assets, while the product focuses on data, research, and risk management.

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:56.660
Built in China and connected globally. Visit gcagochina.com to explore GCA, Go China Access.
